TEST DESIGN TECHNIQUE 
    1. EQUIVALANCE PARTITIONING -
                      - Input data divide into groups (equivalance classes / paritions)
            application -> 18-60
                        - invalid-> less than 18
                        - vlaid -> 18-60
                        - invalid -> greater than 60
          ADV->
              - reduce number of test case 
              - save testing time 
              - good test coverages
        DIS->
